1
00:00:01,181 --> 00:00:09,221
The Princess Sapphire

2
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:50,160
♪ Atashi no miru yume himitsu nano ♪
The dreams I see are my secret

3
00:00:51,250 --> 00:00:57,089
♪ Dare ni mo iwanai himitsu nano ♪
I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret

4
00:00:58,541 --> 00:01:02,461
♪ Akai manto hira hira ♪
A red cape fluttering

5
00:01:02,462 --> 00:01:04,981
♪ Uma o tobasu oujo ♪
Galloping on a horse—the princess

6
00:01:04,981 --> 00:01:06,901
♪ Sore ga atashi ♪
That’s me!

7
00:01:07,621 --> 00:01:10,901
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

8
00:01:10,905 --> 00:01:13,424
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

9
00:01:14,541 --> 00:01:18,021
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

10
00:01:18,140 --> 00:01:20,741
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

11
00:01:21,500 --> 00:01:25,220
♪ Ribon no kishi wa ♪
The Princess Knight,

12
00:01:25,220 --> 00:01:28,621
♪ Honto wa hontto wa ♪
Truly, truly,

13
00:01:28,622 --> 00:01:31,822
♪ Atashi nano sa ♪
It’s really me!

14
00:01:44,101 --> 00:01:50,141
Fourteenth Episode
The Love Letters

15
00:02:11,421 --> 00:02:14,379
It's finished! Finally it's finished!

16
00:02:14,421 --> 00:02:18,016
My camera is finished!
My beautiful camera!

17
00:02:18,061 --> 00:02:20,017
Now I want to try it.

18
00:02:22,941 --> 00:02:26,456
I have to strike a pose! I'll
slip on a suitable outfit and...

19
00:02:27,341 --> 00:02:29,536
I must hurry! The
self-timer is on!

20
00:02:38,021 --> 00:02:39,739
Why isn't it going off?

21
00:02:40,021 --> 00:02:42,740
Hey, Garigori! I heard
that you invented...

22
00:02:42,781 --> 00:02:45,500
...a strange mechanism that
quickly makes small portraits.

23
00:02:45,541 --> 00:02:47,179
Would this be it?

24
00:02:47,221 --> 00:02:48,893
Yes, that's the one, Baron.

25
00:02:49,101 --> 00:02:52,810
But what the hell is in here?! Hey, what are
you doing standing up there like a statue?

26
00:02:53,221 --> 00:02:54,893
But what is this crackling?

27
00:03:01,901 --> 00:03:07,134
Well done, Prince Sapphire! I see that
today you are studying hard. Well done! Well done!

28
00:03:09,061 --> 00:03:11,256
Keep it up.

29
00:03:15,021 --> 00:03:18,331
Dear Sapphire, I had a lot of fun
the other day, with you,

30
00:03:18,381 --> 00:03:20,372
at the carnival party.

31
00:03:20,621 --> 00:03:24,899
It was one of the most beautiful things
I have ever witnessed.

32
00:03:28,421 --> 00:03:32,460
Furthermore, on that same day,
I met a beautiful girl,

33
00:03:32,501 --> 00:03:34,617
who has remained in my heart.

34
00:03:36,821 --> 00:03:40,860
If you remember, she was the girl
I danced with.

35
00:03:47,021 --> 00:03:50,934
I would immensely like
to be able to meet her again.

36
00:03:53,301 --> 00:03:56,134
Therefore, I beg you to find her.

37
00:03:56,181 --> 00:03:59,014
...and arrange a meeting with her
on my behalf.

38
00:04:02,301 --> 00:04:05,577
Best regards.
Prince Franco.

39
00:04:06,341 --> 00:04:10,095
How stupid! The girl he
met was actually me.

40
00:04:10,141 --> 00:04:12,496
Well, Your Highness!
An hour has already passed.

41
00:04:12,541 --> 00:04:14,372
You have studied enough for today.

42
00:04:14,421 --> 00:04:17,094
I want to reward you
for your diligence.

43
00:04:18,781 --> 00:04:21,659
- What has he prepared for me?
- If you stand still for a moment,

44
00:04:21,701 --> 00:04:25,296
I will take a nice picture of you
with my brand-new camera.

45
00:04:25,501 --> 00:04:28,379
Please, Prince,
don't make me waste time!

46
00:04:30,141 --> 00:04:31,893
As you wish!

47
00:04:32,381 --> 00:04:35,498
- No, wait! Don't go!
- So, have you decided?

48
00:04:43,701 --> 00:04:47,250
I could take it with this
headpiece and with this girl's dress.

49
00:04:47,301 --> 00:04:49,610
- Oh, no!
- I know I can't.

50
00:04:49,661 --> 00:04:51,936
Prince Sapphire, a photo
of you dressed up like this...

51
00:04:51,981 --> 00:04:53,016
...would make it obvious
that you are a girl!

52
00:04:53,061 --> 00:04:57,657
This photo could even fall into
the hands of Grand Duke Geralamon!

53
00:04:57,701 --> 00:05:00,056
What a tragedy would
that be for our kingdom?

54
00:05:00,581 --> 00:05:03,334
And what would you want
to do with this photo, anyway?

55
00:05:04,621 --> 00:05:07,419
I won't tell you! It's
none of your business.

56
00:05:11,621 --> 00:05:13,452
I know how you feel, Your Highness.

57
00:05:13,501 --> 00:05:16,334
I know how difficult it is for you
to pretend to be a boy...

58
00:05:16,381 --> 00:05:18,895
...while you are, in reality,
a beautiful young girl!

59
00:05:18,941 --> 00:05:22,092
All right, I want to please you!
I will take one for you just how you want it.

60
00:05:22,141 --> 00:05:24,575
- Poor little thing...!
- Thank you, Garigori!

61
00:05:35,261 --> 00:05:37,013
What a serious look!

62
00:05:37,341 --> 00:05:40,651
But I think Prince Franco will still
like this photo anyway.

63
00:05:40,701 --> 00:05:43,340
"To Prince Franco,
in the kingdom of Terradoro".

64
00:05:47,701 --> 00:05:49,259
Opal!

65
00:05:51,741 --> 00:05:54,096
Go mail
this letter for me!

66
00:06:01,181 --> 00:06:02,819
Well, well!

67
00:06:20,020 --> 00:06:22,091
Darn, I can't reach it!

68
00:06:24,500 --> 00:06:26,537
Oh, yes! There we go!

69
00:06:27,180 --> 00:06:30,332
Thank you, little horse!
You were really kind!

70
00:06:35,020 --> 00:06:37,012
I would like to know
the contents of the letter...

71
00:06:37,060 --> 00:06:40,337
...that Sapphire had Opal mail!
You see to it, 0017!

72
00:06:40,420 --> 00:06:43,140
Don't worry, Baron Neelon.
It will be a piece of cake.

73
00:06:43,180 --> 00:06:46,412
First of all,
I will use disguise number 85.

74
00:06:46,460 --> 00:06:48,053
Voilà!

75
00:06:48,740 --> 00:06:51,414
A spy's first task
is to steal other people's mail.

76
00:07:06,020 --> 00:07:08,740
Hey, is everyone in this village
a graphomaniac!

77
00:07:15,020 --> 00:07:17,012
This one is going to a Prince.

78
00:07:26,420 --> 00:07:28,935
Second task:
if nothing was found,

79
00:07:28,980 --> 00:07:31,256
return the mail,
so as not to arouse suspicion.

80
00:07:33,620 --> 00:07:35,498
End of the disguise!

81
00:07:36,100 --> 00:07:38,217
Good secret agent, huh?

82
00:07:44,500 --> 00:07:46,890
You say there wasn't
any letter from Sapphire?

83
00:07:46,940 --> 00:07:48,818
It's absolutely impossible!

84
00:07:48,860 --> 00:07:50,852
I checked all the letters
one by one!

85
00:07:50,900 --> 00:07:54,530
There was no suspicious letter
addressed to Prince Franz.

86
00:07:54,580 --> 00:07:57,254
But then, maybe, this was it!
Did you check it well?

87
00:07:57,300 --> 00:08:00,372
- I hope you opened it.
- Yes! And inside I found...

88
00:08:00,420 --> 00:08:03,413
..a photograph
of a beautiful girl!

89
00:08:03,860 --> 00:08:06,898
Idiot! That was exactly the one
I was looking for! Go get it!

90
00:08:06,940 --> 00:08:09,739
At your command!
I'm going to redo the job!

91
00:08:09,780 --> 00:08:12,170
I'm flying!

92
00:08:15,460 --> 00:08:17,338
When I have that photo..

93
00:08:22,340 --> 00:08:24,809
Excuse me, Your Highness,
what did you do with that photo?

94
00:08:24,860 --> 00:08:27,216
Be careful not to lose it,
please.

95
00:08:27,260 --> 00:08:29,058
It could be dangerous.

96
00:08:29,340 --> 00:08:31,332
These are unsafe times

97
00:08:31,380 --> 00:08:33,133
Why? What happened?

98
00:08:33,180 --> 00:08:36,252
They ambushed a mail coach
and robbed it!

99
00:08:36,300 --> 00:08:38,576
- What?!
- You're scaring me like that!

100
00:08:38,620 --> 00:08:40,816
- Where did they attack him?
- I heard it was...

101
00:08:40,860 --> 00:08:43,011
...at the North pasture.
- Oh, no!

102
00:08:46,421 --> 00:08:48,571
They're looking for my letter!
Let's go!

103
00:09:06,421 --> 00:09:09,219
Damn wind!
It's driving me crazy!

104
00:09:13,341 --> 00:09:16,094
I didn't imagine it would
be so exhausting being a spy!

105
00:09:16,621 --> 00:09:19,340
There, I got it! No! This
one is slipping away, damn it!

106
00:09:19,541 --> 00:09:21,611
I feel like I'm going crazy!

107
00:09:22,301 --> 00:09:24,257
- Who's coming?
- Here's who took the letters!

108
00:09:25,301 --> 00:09:27,019
Drop that sack!

109
00:09:30,421 --> 00:09:33,174
My sack!
Sorry, but it's still mine!

110
00:09:33,221 --> 00:09:35,018
He took it back!

111
00:09:39,621 --> 00:09:41,896
Third task: climb trees!

112
00:09:43,741 --> 00:09:46,813
Damned meddler! I'll
make you fall from this tree!

113
00:09:46,861 --> 00:09:48,692
Fourth task: never fall!

114
00:09:53,661 --> 00:09:56,778
Fifth task:
escape the enemy by any means!

115
00:09:56,821 --> 00:09:59,858
- Bye-bye! See ya!
- He's getting away, damn it!

116
00:09:59,901 --> 00:10:01,812
- Wait!
- I can't wait!

117
00:10:01,861 --> 00:10:03,897
I have an urgent appointment!

118
00:10:05,861 --> 00:10:09,331
- Fine, you asked for it!
- No! Not the anti-aircraft, please!

119
00:10:09,661 --> 00:10:12,539
My father used to tell
me not to aim too high!

120
00:10:19,661 --> 00:10:21,811
Stop, little goat! Give
me back that letter!

121
00:10:21,861 --> 00:10:25,251
- A goat?!
- Come here, be good!

122
00:10:25,621 --> 00:10:27,737
Goats like paper.

123
00:10:27,901 --> 00:10:31,132
- Yeah! She'll eat the letter!
- Come, Opal!

124
00:10:36,061 --> 00:10:39,690
Stop, you damned eater
of mail!

125
00:10:42,901 --> 00:10:46,655
Fourth task of a spy: in
case of emergency, jump!

126
00:10:47,501 --> 00:10:49,139
Wait!

127
00:10:51,661 --> 00:10:53,891
Excuse me,
I'm in a bit of a hurry!

128
00:10:59,341 --> 00:11:01,809
The road forks here.
Where did they go?

129
00:11:20,541 --> 00:11:22,532
What? How come I don't see her anymore?

130
00:11:23,021 --> 00:11:26,331
Where did she end up
that damned goat?

131
00:11:49,261 --> 00:11:52,173
Open up, my children!
I am your mother!

132
00:11:53,101 --> 00:11:55,296
It's mommy!
Come on in, mommy!

133
00:11:55,341 --> 00:11:59,539
- Hi, mom!
- Hi, mom! Mommy!

134
00:11:59,581 --> 00:12:02,254
- We missed you!
- Mommy!

135
00:12:02,461 --> 00:12:04,577
I missed you so much.

136
00:12:04,621 --> 00:12:07,693
I hope you didn't let
anyone in while I was away.

137
00:12:07,741 --> 00:12:10,096
Oh, no, mom! No one!

138
00:12:10,141 --> 00:12:14,020
There are very bad men
around, so be careful.

139
00:12:14,061 --> 00:12:16,814
- Yes, mom!
- This is your dinner

140
00:12:16,861 --> 00:12:18,692
What do you think of it?

141
00:12:19,341 --> 00:12:21,138
Open up!

142
00:12:28,341 --> 00:12:30,252
I'll get in through there.

143
00:12:30,461 --> 00:12:33,737
I guess that means
I'll have to imitate Santa Claus.

144
00:12:34,861 --> 00:12:38,297
Cheer up! Santa Claus is coming!

145
00:12:38,741 --> 00:12:41,892
Santa Claus is coming!
He'll come down the chimney!

146
00:12:41,941 --> 00:12:44,011
He's a bad man! Hide!

147
00:12:44,061 --> 00:12:45,892
A man?!

148
00:12:45,941 --> 00:12:48,853
Here is Santa Claus!

149
00:12:48,901 --> 00:12:52,177
I was passing by this way
and I said to myself:

150
00:12:52,221 --> 00:12:56,373
"Why not pay a little visit
to this lovely little family?"

151
00:13:05,901 --> 00:13:08,335
How strange,
he leaves wolf tracks!

152
00:13:08,381 --> 00:13:11,020
And yet only that goat
passed by here.

153
00:13:19,101 --> 00:13:21,740
This house is too solid!
Clever, these goats!

154
00:13:21,941 --> 00:13:23,852
Look, a crack!

155
00:13:23,901 --> 00:13:26,256
I've found the weak spot.
Now I'll take care of it.

156
00:13:29,821 --> 00:13:33,018
It's wide enough to see
inside. Here are the letters!

157
00:13:35,741 --> 00:13:39,256
They look delicious! I'm going
to eat them right away! Yes, yes!

158
00:13:39,541 --> 00:13:43,898
No! Don't eat that
letter! Please, wait! Stop!

159
00:13:43,941 --> 00:13:45,897
If mom sees you, she'll scold you!

160
00:13:45,941 --> 00:13:48,739
What do I do now? I have
to give her something else!

161
00:13:48,781 --> 00:13:51,500
I don't have paper, I only
have money! I have no choice.

162
00:13:51,541 --> 00:13:54,658
Look, little goat! This is
much better than the letter!

163
00:13:54,741 --> 00:13:57,301
Here! Taste it, come on! Eat!

164
00:13:58,021 --> 00:14:00,330
There goes 10,000 Scudi!

165
00:14:00,901 --> 00:14:02,812
Good! Will you give me some more?

166
00:14:02,861 --> 00:14:04,499
What?! Those weren't enough for you?

167
00:14:04,541 --> 00:14:06,736
If you don't give them
to me, I'll eat this letter

168
00:14:06,781 --> 00:14:11,332
Stop! Please, no! Enough!
I'll give you more! Here, take it!

169
00:14:11,381 --> 00:14:13,212
I can't watch...

170
00:14:14,101 --> 00:14:16,774
- More, please!
- Here!

171
00:14:18,341 --> 00:14:20,093
One more!

172
00:14:20,141 --> 00:14:23,736
Damn it, I don't have any more!
I'm ruined!

173
00:14:24,381 --> 00:14:29,136
Well, children! Since that man
has gone, we can eat.

174
00:14:29,541 --> 00:14:31,611
Great! I was so hungry!

175
00:14:35,821 --> 00:14:38,813
Open up! Open, damn wolf!

176
00:14:40,061 --> 00:14:43,531
I realized that you are actually a wolf
and you disguised yourself as a goat!

177
00:14:50,261 --> 00:14:54,413
I recognized your footprints!
You won't manage to trick me! Open up!

178
00:14:58,341 --> 00:15:01,413
He climbed onto the roof!
He wants to get in through the chimney!

179
00:15:05,541 --> 00:15:07,418
Where could they have hidden?

180
00:15:07,661 --> 00:15:10,733
Don't eat our dinner! No!

181
00:15:23,341 --> 00:15:25,013
You're here!

182
00:15:29,101 --> 00:15:30,693
No!

183
00:15:49,461 --> 00:15:51,258
- Mama!
- Mommy!

184
00:15:51,901 --> 00:15:54,859
Let me go! Let me go! No!

185
00:16:14,221 --> 00:16:16,098
Mommy!

186
00:16:18,501 --> 00:16:21,379
Don't let the little goats find out
who I really am!

187
00:16:21,421 --> 00:16:23,537
- What?!
- He's coming here!

188
00:16:24,781 --> 00:16:27,500
Why do you live with the little goats,
you who are a she-wolf?

189
00:16:27,541 --> 00:16:31,819
Now I will tell you why.
My husband is the master of the woods

190
00:16:32,381 --> 00:16:35,134
Some time ago he devoured
the mother of those little goats,

191
00:16:35,181 --> 00:16:37,615
then he ordered me
to stay with his children

192
00:16:37,661 --> 00:16:40,733
So I disguised myself as a goat
and now I live with them.

193
00:16:43,101 --> 00:16:47,174
Now I understand: you act like a goat
so as not to raise suspicion!

194
00:16:47,221 --> 00:16:50,293
That's right! My husband wants
me to fatten up the kids well for him...

195
00:16:50,341 --> 00:16:53,094
...before eating them.
You know, I've raised them until now...

196
00:16:53,141 --> 00:16:57,020
...as if I were their mother
and they believe I'm the real one.

197
00:16:57,061 --> 00:17:01,339
They love me. No one, before,
had loved me so much...

198
00:17:01,381 --> 00:17:03,815
.and I treat them like my own children.

199
00:17:03,861 --> 00:17:06,329
Mind you tell me the truth,
otherwise...

200
00:17:06,501 --> 00:17:08,810
Believe me,
I've grown fond of them too

201
00:17:08,861 --> 00:17:11,295
I love them
as if they were wolf pups.

202
00:17:11,901 --> 00:17:14,574
So much so that when my husband
comes to ask for them,

203
00:17:14,621 --> 00:17:16,657
I won't let him take them!

204
00:17:16,821 --> 00:17:20,496
I will defend their little lives
even at the cost of my own!

205
00:17:23,221 --> 00:17:25,337
This whole story has moved me!

206
00:17:28,821 --> 00:17:31,016
But a spy
shouldn't get emotional!

207
00:17:31,061 --> 00:17:34,019
I will take advantage of the situation
and go get the letters!

208
00:17:36,221 --> 00:17:39,372
- What is it?
- It's my husband coming!

209
00:17:39,421 --> 00:17:42,697
He is coming here because the time has come for him
to devour the kids!

210
00:17:42,741 --> 00:17:44,493
What can I do?!

211
00:17:56,141 --> 00:17:58,211
She-wolf, can I kill him?

212
00:17:58,741 --> 00:18:01,016
If this can save the kids,
yes

213
00:18:15,821 --> 00:18:17,493
Good heavens!

214
00:18:19,701 --> 00:18:21,896
Have you fattened the kids?

215
00:18:21,941 --> 00:18:23,533
How scary!

216
00:18:23,581 --> 00:18:26,049
Yes, of course.
I fattened them just as you wanted.

217
00:18:26,341 --> 00:18:28,696
Do you think they are big enough?

218
00:18:28,741 --> 00:18:30,459
Yes, my husband.

219
00:18:30,501 --> 00:18:35,017
You look so much like a goat that I
feel like eating you too!

220
00:18:38,741 --> 00:18:40,413
Take this!

221
00:18:47,381 --> 00:18:51,010
With an injured tongue,
I can no longer eat the kids!

222
00:19:04,541 --> 00:19:07,578
That bad guy
will eat our mother!

223
00:19:07,621 --> 00:19:09,816
Without a sword he won't make it!

224
00:19:28,301 --> 00:19:29,893
Help!

225
00:19:30,901 --> 00:19:32,778
You will pay for this!

226
00:19:45,341 --> 00:19:47,093
If he runs into me..!

227
00:20:00,701 --> 00:20:03,898
I've been traveling for a long time,
looking for a beautiful landscape...

228
00:20:03,941 --> 00:20:06,216
...to immortalize in a
beautiful photograph!

229
00:20:11,141 --> 00:20:13,177
What do I see! It's a great subject!

230
00:20:13,461 --> 00:20:15,611
This photo will be a masterpiece!

231
00:20:18,301 --> 00:20:20,019
Damn it!

232
00:20:20,341 --> 00:20:22,411
The Prince is in trouble!

233
00:20:30,021 --> 00:20:32,012
This tree will stop him!

234
00:20:38,101 --> 00:20:40,410
It's me: Garigori!
Prince Sapphire!

235
00:20:40,461 --> 00:20:43,897
Hold on, I'm coming to help you!
Charge!

236
00:20:43,941 --> 00:20:46,216
I will use my photographic weapons!

237
00:20:52,261 --> 00:20:54,138
You hit him! Good!

238
00:20:54,741 --> 00:20:56,333
And now it's my turn!

239
00:21:01,861 --> 00:21:05,649
- I did it! Thanks, Garigori!
- The enemy has been defeated!

240
00:21:06,661 --> 00:21:09,573
- Thanks to you! - I'm happy
that you are safe, Your Highness.

241
00:21:10,741 --> 00:21:15,098
Meanwhile, secret agent 0017
hasn't been sitting idle!

242
00:21:16,301 --> 00:21:19,213
I got all the letters!
Here is the one I was looking for!

243
00:21:19,261 --> 00:21:21,217
I'll run and take it to the Baron!

244
00:21:23,621 --> 00:21:26,260
He's running away with our dinner!

245
00:21:27,181 --> 00:21:30,730
Stop, you dirty thief!
It's our dinner!

246
00:21:30,781 --> 00:21:34,774
Give us back our dinner!
Give us back our dinner!

247
00:21:34,821 --> 00:21:36,618
Oh! The letters!

248
00:21:37,101 --> 00:21:38,898
Good heavens!

249
00:21:38,941 --> 00:21:41,933
That's our dinner!
Our dinner!

250
00:21:41,981 --> 00:21:43,892
Give us back our meal!

251
00:21:48,021 --> 00:21:50,740
Our dinner! Dinner!

252
00:21:56,101 --> 00:21:58,410
I'll get out of your way immediately!

253
00:22:04,901 --> 00:22:06,573
But you...!

254
00:22:11,661 --> 00:22:14,334
Yes, little goats,
I am just as you see me.

255
00:22:14,381 --> 00:22:17,532
- I am a she-wolf.
- Mama, I don't care who you are.

256
00:22:17,581 --> 00:22:19,697
- You are always my mama.
- What?!

257
00:22:19,741 --> 00:22:23,893
Yes, mama! Come eat
dinner with us! Come! Come!

258
00:22:24,341 --> 00:22:28,619
Do you still believe I am your mother
despite my terrible appearance?

259
00:22:28,661 --> 00:22:31,539
Yes, mama! You are still
our mama!

260
00:22:31,581 --> 00:22:34,891
How sweet you are, my children

261
00:22:34,941 --> 00:22:37,091
Mama! Mommy!

262
00:22:45,021 --> 00:22:47,774
Now, little ones,
eat peacefully.

263
00:22:49,101 --> 00:22:51,171
Thank you, mama.

264
00:22:51,421 --> 00:22:54,811
How delicious!

265
00:22:59,501 --> 00:23:01,219
Tell me: do you like it?

266
00:23:04,501 --> 00:23:08,176
Now we will take a keepsake photo!
Gather together in a group, everyone!

267
00:23:22,901 --> 00:23:25,290
Did you see, Garigori?
Even a she-wolf...

268
00:23:25,341 --> 00:23:27,775
...can take the appearance
of a goat and save the little ones.

269
00:23:27,821 --> 00:23:30,176
I too will continue to pretend
to be a boy...

270
00:23:30,221 --> 00:23:32,212
...to save my people.

271
00:23:42,021 --> 00:23:44,091
Farewell, friends!

272
00:23:44,141 --> 00:23:48,020
- Goodbye!
- Goodbye!

273
00:23:48,141 --> 00:23:51,178
- Thank you!
- Bye! Bye!

274
00:23:52,021 --> 00:23:54,296
- Bye!
- Goodbye!

275
